4. Historical Defect Schema

Historical defects are collected from public datasets associated with projects such as Mozilla, Apache, and Eclipse.

The proposed standardized historical defect structure is:

Field	Data Type	Description
bug_id	String	Unique historical bug identifier
project	String	Source project
title	String	Historical bug title
description	Text	Detailed bug description
component	String	Affected software component
severity	String	Severity of the defect
priority	String	Priority of the defect
stack_trace	Text	Stack trace, if available
comments	Text	Historical discussion/comments
resolution	String	Final resolution
fix_information	Text	Information about the fix
source	String	Dataset/source information
