17. Conclusion

The proposed data model provides a structured foundation for the Intelligent Bug Diagnosis Platform.

It standardizes newly submitted bug reports and historical defects while preserving important technical information such as stack traces, comments, resolutions, and fix information.

The model also supports the RAG pipeline by connecting historical defect chunks and their embeddings with the original bug metadata. This allows the AI agent layer to retrieve relevant historical evidence and use it during diagnosis and fix recommendation.
